# Plans, intentions and attempts
#
# A plan isn't its outcome. The anklet sale never completes.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m13_plans> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Plans, intentions and attempts" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E7_Activity

iy:Intention a owl:Class .
iy:Attempt a owl:Class .
iy:Motive a owl:Class .

iy:purpose a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:intendedBy a owl:ObjectProperty .
